{"id":5262,"date":"2026-07-07T08:12:27","date_gmt":"2026-07-07T08:12:27","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/?p=5262"},"modified":"2026-07-28T10:38:31","modified_gmt":"2026-07-28T10:38:31","slug":"web-developer-salary","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-developer-salary\/","title":{"rendered":"Web Developer Salary in India (Per Month &#038; Yearly Package 2026)\u00a0"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>The demand for web developers in India is rising in 2026 as businesses across industries continue to expand their digital presence. Companies are focusing more on improving their websites, applications, and online platforms to reach a wider audience and enhance customer engagement in an increasingly competitive digital environment.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>With the growing use of modern technologies and development tools, skilled professionals are finding better career opportunities in startups, IT firms, and multinational companies. This increasing demand has created strong earning potential for individuals who stay updated with the latest industry trends, frameworks, and practical technical skills.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In this guide, we will discuss the&nbsp;web developer salary&nbsp;in India in 2026 based on experience level, job roles, skills, location, and company type to help you understand salary trends and future career growth opportunities in this field.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read:<\/strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-developer-job-description\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Web Developer Job Description (Roles and Responsibilities)<\/a>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Who Is a Web Developer?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Web developers are skilled professionals responsible for creating and\u00a0maintaining\u00a0websites and web applications. They handle the coding and programming of web-based platforms and play\u00a0an important role\u00a0in ensuring that a website looks good and functions smoothly. By using <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-programming-languages\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">programming languages<\/a> such as\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">HTML<\/a>,\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/css\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">CSS<\/a>, and\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/javascript\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">JavaScript<\/a>, they turn a client\u2019s idea into a fully functional and responsive website. They also use modern frameworks and libraries to build interactive and user-friendly websites that deliver a seamless browsing experience across different devices.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Many people often find it difficult to differentiate between web developers and web designers. Web developers are more technically focused, while web designers&nbsp;mainly handle&nbsp;the look, feel, and appearance of a website. Developers concentrate on the functionality and performance of the website. Their responsibilities include:&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Designing the visual appearance and user interface of websites&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Crafting and managing web content&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Building and coding the underlying framework of a website&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Creating a user-friendly browsing experience&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Testing&nbsp;different functions&nbsp;and features of a website&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Types of Web Developers<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Web developers are&nbsp;mainly divided&nbsp;into three types based on their area of expertise in building and&nbsp;maintaining&nbsp;websites or web applications. Each type focuses on a specific part of the development process to ensure that a website is visually appealing, fully functional, and provides a smooth user experience.&nbsp;Let\u2019s&nbsp;explore the&nbsp;different types&nbsp;of web developers involved in developing a complete website.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/web-developer-types.webp\" alt=\"Types of Web Developers\" class=\"wp-image-21376\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/web-developer-types.webp 2560w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/web-developer-types-300x169.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/web-developer-types-1024x576.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/web-developer-types-768x432.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/web-developer-types-1536x864.webp 1536w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/web-developer-types-2048x1152.webp 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Front-End Developers<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Front-end developers&nbsp;are responsible for&nbsp;creating the visual layout and interactive elements of a website that users see and use, which is known as&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/front-end-development\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">front-end development<\/a>. They work on improving the user interface and overall experience by using technologies such as HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and basic UI\/UX design principles to build responsive and attractive web pages.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Back-End Developers<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Back-end developers&nbsp;manage the server-side functionality of a website. They focus on handling databases, application logic, and server operations that ensure the proper functioning of a website. To perform these tasks, they use programming languages such as PHP, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/python\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Python<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Java<\/a>, and other&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/backend-technologies\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">back-end technologies<\/a>.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Full-Stack Developers<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>They have&nbsp;expertise&nbsp;in both front-end and back-end development, allowing them to manage the complete&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/web-development-roadmap\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">web development&nbsp;roadmap<\/a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;process, including designing user interfaces, handling server-side operations, managing databases, and ensuring smooth website performance.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Now,&nbsp;let\u2019s&nbsp;take a look&nbsp;at the&nbsp;web developer salary in India&nbsp;based on&nbsp;different factors.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wscube-courses mb-2\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3 class=\"mb-4\">Recommended Professional <\/br> Certificates<\/h3>\n\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel courseOwl\">\n\n                \n                    \n                    <div class=\"course-card card-r rounded-4\">\n\n                        <!-- \u2705 SINGLE MEDIA DIV (FIXED) -->\n                        <div class=\"course-media\"\n                             data-lottie=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/uploads\/images\/courses\/json-images\/web-devlopment.json\"\n                             data-fallback=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-