\" \/>\n                <\/a>\n            <\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Website Developer Salary in India (Based on Location)<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Although many companies now offer remote or hybrid work options to web developers, location still plays&nbsp;an important role&nbsp;in&nbsp;determining&nbsp;salary packages. In India, Hyderabad is known to offer some of the highest salaries, with web developers earning&nbsp;nearly 25%\u201327% more than professionals in other cities.&nbsp;Bangalore&nbsp;is another leading IT hub that offers around 20%\u201325% higher salaries than the national average due to the presence of top tech companies and startups.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Here\u2019s&nbsp;a table to give insights into&nbsp;web developer salaries&nbsp;in India based on different cities:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>City<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><td><strong>Average Web Developer Salary (Per Year)<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Bangalore&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b94,00,000 \u2013 \u20b911,00,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Chennai&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b94,00,000 \u2013 \u20b910,50,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Mumbai&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b93,50,000 \u2013 \u20b98,50,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Pune&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b93,20,000 \u2013 \u20b98,80,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Noida \/ New Delhi&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b93,80,000 \u2013 \u20b910,00,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Hyderabad&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b94,50,000 \u2013 \u20b911,50,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Web developers working in major IT hubs&nbsp;generally receive&nbsp;better salary packages due to higher demand, company presence, and greater career opportunities compared to smaller cities.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Web Developer Jobs Salary in India (Based on Company)&nbsp;<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The bigger the company, the higher the salary you can expect. Web developers who have worked on impressive projects or are applying for a job in a leading company can expect a higher salary package. Here is a table showing salary packages offered by leading organizations in India.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Here is a table showing the average salary packages offered by top organizations in India:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Company Name<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><td><strong>Average Web Developer Salary (Per Year)<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>TCS&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b93,60,000 \u2013 \u20b98,50,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Infosys Limited&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b93,50,000 \u2013 \u20b96,20,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Wipro&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b93,20,000 \u2013 \u20b97,80,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Cognizant&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b93,40,000 \u2013 \u20b910,50,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Amazon Inc.&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b96,00,000 \u2013 \u20b918,00,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Zoho Corporation&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b95,50,000 \u2013 \u20b98,00,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Capgemini&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b93,80,000 \u2013 \u20b97,20,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Publicis Sapient&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b95,80,000 \u2013 \u20b910,00,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>HCL Technologies&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b93,70,000 \u2013 \u20b99,20,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Salary packages may vary based on experience level, job role, and technical&nbsp;expertise.&nbsp;Developers working in product-based companies generally receive higher pay compared to service-based organizations.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-7ab0c851046a906928eb9cd2d144f8f2\"><strong>Read More Web Development Related Guides<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\"