actJS&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b94,15,000&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b934,000 \u2013 \u20b938,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Web Developer and Designer&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b93,20,000&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b926,000 \u2013 \u20b930,000&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Developers with&nbsp;expertise&nbsp;in advanced frameworks and modern programming languages are more likely to receive higher salary packages and better career growth opportunities in the&nbsp;web development&nbsp;road.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Salary of Web Developers (Based on Qualifications)<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The&nbsp;salary of web developers in India&nbsp;can also vary based on their educational qualifications and professional certifications.&nbsp;Candidates with relevant degrees in computer science, information technology, or web development often receive better salary packages compared to those with basic or non-technical qualifications.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Here\u2019s&nbsp;a table showing the average salary of web developers in India based on their qualifications:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Qualification<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><td><strong>Average Salary (Per Year)<\/strong>&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Postgraduate&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b95,50,000+&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Undergraduate&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b94,50,000+&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Diploma Holder&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b93,50,000+&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Certification Courses&nbsp;<\/td><td>\u20b93,20,000+&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Web developers with higher qualifications and industry-recognized certifications are more likely to secure better job opportunities and higher salary packages in top IT companies.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-5b7e271448582f3dc6b27c47cabe6be0\"><strong>Explore Our Web Development Related Courses<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/full-stack-developer-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Online Full Stack Developer Course<\/a><\/td><td class=\"has-text-align-center\" data-align=\"center\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/wordpress-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=BlogInterlink&amp;utm_campaign=seo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Online WordPress Course<\/a><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Factors Affecting Website Developer Salary<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Various factors&nbsp;impact&nbsp;the&nbsp;average salary of a web developer in India. These&nbsp;important factors&nbsp;are outlined in the section below:<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/factors-affecting-website-developer-salary.webp\" alt=\"Factors Affecting Website Developer Salary\" class=\"wp-image-21377\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/factors-affecting-website-developer-salary.webp 2560w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/factors-affecting-website-developer-salary-300x169.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/factors-affecting-website-developer-salary-1024x576.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/factors-affecting-website-developer-salary-768x432.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/factors-affecting-website-developer-salary-1536x864.webp 1536w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/factors-affecting-website-developer-salary-2048x1152.webp 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Company or Employer<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>The organization you work for plays&nbsp;a major role&nbsp;in deciding your salary.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Companies:&nbsp;<\/strong>Reputed IT giants such as TCS, Infosys, Wipro, and other large corporations&nbsp;generally offer&nbsp;competitive salary packages. Mid-level web developers in such companies can expect an average annual salary between \u20b97\u201310 LPA, depending on their&nbsp;expertise&nbsp;and role.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Startups:&nbsp;<\/strong>Working in a startup can be exciting and&nbsp;provide&nbsp;strong learning opportunities. However, initial salaries may be slightly lower compared to large IT firms. Junior-level web developers in startups usually earn between \u20b94\u20137 LPA. Some startups may also offer&nbsp;additional&nbsp;perks, bonuses, or equity benefits.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Industry Dynamics &amp; Domain Expertise:&nbsp;<\/strong>The industry you work in also&nbsp;impacts&nbsp;your salary. For example, developers with experience in e-commerce platforms often earn competitive packages ranging between \u20b95\u201310 LPA annually.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Size of the Company:&nbsp;<\/strong>Large-scale companies typically offer higher salaries along with structured benefits. Smaller companies may offer slightly lower pay but provide broader exposure and faster career growth.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Demand and Supply<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Market demand significantly affects salary levels. When the demand for skilled web developers is high and the supply of qualified professionals is limited, companies tend to offer higher salary packages to attract top talent.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Experience<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Experience is one of the most important salary-determining factors. Entry-level developers usually start with an average salary of around \u20b94 LPA. As experience increases, earning potential rises significantly. Experienced developers with strong portfolios and technical&nbsp;expertise&nbsp;can earn \u20b915 LPA or more. Greater experience reflects problem-solving ability, technical understanding, and the capability to manage complex projects.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Location<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Location is another&nbsp;important factor&nbsp;that&nbsp;impacts&nbsp;the salary packages of web developers. Developers working in metro cities such as Delhi, Noida,&nbsp;Bangalore, and Mumbai usually earn higher salaries compared to those working in smaller cities&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Skills<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Technical skills and&nbsp;proficiency&nbsp;in modern programming languages and frameworks play a crucial role in salary growth.&nbsp;Expertise&nbsp;in technologies like&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/python\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Python<\/a>, React, and JavaScript can significantly increase earning potential. Full-stack developers often earn more than developers specializing only in front-end or back-end development because of their versatility.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Credentials and Certifications<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Relevant certifications from recognized institutes can boost your credibility and salary prospects. Certified web developers may receive up to a 20% higher salary compared to non-certified professionals, especially when certifications are aligned with in-demand technologies.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read:&nbsp;<\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/javascript\/programs\/square-root\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">JavaScript Program to Find the Square Root: With Examples<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FAQs About Web Developer Salary<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"schema-faq wp-block-yoast-faq-block\"><div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1783409423544\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">1. What is the average web developer salary in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">The average web developer salary in India ranges between\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.ambitionbox.com\/profile\/web-developer-salary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">\u20b94.5 LPA and \u20b95 LPA<\/a>. Your earnings depend on experience, skills, company type, and location. If you work in a metro city or a product-based company, you can expect higher compensation.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1783409432708\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">2. What is the starting salary of a web developer in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">As a fresher, your starting salary as a web developer in India usually ranges from \u20b93 LPA to \u20b95 LPA. If you have strong projects, internships, or in-demand skills, you may receive a better\u00a0initial\u00a0package.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1783409448547\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">3.\u00a0What is the web developer salary per month in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">The\u00a0web developer salary in India\u00a0typically ranges from \u20b925,000 to \u20b942,000 per month. Your monthly income increases as you gain experience, switch companies, or develop\u00a0expertise\u00a0in modern frameworks and full-stack development.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1783409461060\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">4. Do full-stack developers earn more than front-end developers?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes, you can earn more as a full-stack developer because you handle both front-end and back-end tasks. Companies value versatility, so full-stack professionals often receive higher packages compared to specialists focusing only on one area.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1783409478378\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">5. Which city offers the highest salary for web developers in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">If you work in cities like\u00a0Bangalore, Hyderabad, Pune, or Mumbai, you can expect higher salaries as a web developer. These major tech hubs offer better job opportunities due to strong industry demand, a higher number of startups, and leading IT companies actively hiring skilled developers.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1783409491166\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">6. Which company pays the highest salary to web developers in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Top product-based companies like Amazon and leading tech firms generally offer higher salary packages.\u00a0If you join a reputed company with strong technical skills and experience, you can secure a significantly better pay scale.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1783409504457\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">7. How much does a 5-year experienced web developer earn in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">With five years of experience, you can earn between \u20b97 LPA and \u20b912 LPA. If you specialize in high-demand technologies or work in a large organization, your salary can grow even beyond this range.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1783409518873\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">8. Is web development a high-paying career in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes, web development can be a high-paying career if you continuously upgrade your skills. When you gain strong experience, learn modern frameworks, and build a solid portfolio, your earning potential increases significantly.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1783409533132\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">9. Does location affect web developer salary in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes, your\u00a0web developer salary\u00a0in India\u00a0is influenced by your location. If you work in metro cities, you can earn higher pay due to strong industry demand, better job opportunities, and higher living costs, while smaller cities may offer comparatively lower salary packages for developers.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1783409551444\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">10. Which skills increase web developer salary the most?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Skills like React, Node.js, Python, TypeScript, and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-full-stack-development\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">full-stack development<\/a> can significantly increase your salary. When you master modern tools and frameworks, you become more valuable to companies looking for skilled professionals.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1783409564488\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">11. How much can a freelance web developer earn in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">As a freelance web developer, you have the potential to earn between \u20b915,000 and \u20b91,00,000 or more per month. Your income depends on client quality, project complexity, experience level, and your ability to attract international clients.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1783409580132\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">12. What is the highest salary of a web developer in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Senior web developers and experienced full-stack professionals in top companies can earn \u20b920 LPA or more. If you work in product-based firms or international companies, your salary can go even higher.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1783409594213\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">13. Do certifications increase web developer salary?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes, certifications can improve your credibility and help you negotiate better pay. When you combine certifications with real project experience, you increase your chances of getting higher salary offers and better career opportunities in the web development field.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1783409606657\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">14. Is web development a good career in 2026?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Yes, web development\u00a0remains\u00a0a strong career choice in 2026. As businesses continue to grow online, you can expect steady demand, career growth opportunities, and competitive salary packages across industries.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1783409619092\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">15. How can I increase my web developer salary in India?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">You can increase your salary by learning advanced technologies, building real-world projects, gaining experience, and switching to better-paying companies. Continuous skill improvement and strong problem-solving ability will help you earn more over time.<\/p> <\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/full-stack-developer-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=Content_Banner&amp;utm_campaign=SEO&amp;utm_page=\/web-developer-salary\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1546\" height=\"452\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/full-stack-developer-online-course.webp\" alt=\"Full Stack Development Course\" class=\"wp-image-13738\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/b